tos!\\r\\n</pre></td>\\r\\n</tr> </table>\\r\\n\\r\\n**Caso de prueba 2:** \\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Entrada</th>\\r\\n <th>Salida</th>\\r\\n</tr> \\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td> \\r\\n<pre>\\r\\nLaplaceTeam 70\\r\\nDerivadores 50\\r\\nLaplaceTeam -10\\r\\nDerivadores 30\\r\\nPiLovers 90\\r\\nDerivadores 10\\r\\nPiLovers -20\\r\\nDerivadores 5\\r\\nFin de los juegos\\r\\n</pre> </td>\\r\\n <td>\\r\\n<pre>\\r\\nDerivadores es la alianza campeona con 95 puntos!\\r\\n</pre></td>\\r\\n</tr> </table>\\r\\n**Caso de prueba 3:** \\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Entrada</th>\\r\\n <th>Salida</th>\\r\\n</tr> \\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td> \\r\\n<pre>\\r\\nFourierBros 25\\r\\nNewtonicas 40\\r\\nGaussGurus 10\\r\\nFourierBros 15\\r\\nGaussGurus 30\\r\\nNewtonicas 0\\r\\nFin de los juegos\\r\\n</pre> </td>\\r\\n <td>\\r\\n<pre>\\r\\nFourierBros es la alianza campeona con 40 puntos!\\r\\nGaussGurus es la alianza campeona con 40 puntos!\\r\\nNewtonicas es la alianza campeona con 40 puntos!\\r\\n</pre></td>\\r\\n</tr> </table>\", \"group\": 11, \"time_limit\": 1.0, \"memory_limit\": 102400, \"short_circuit\": false, \"points\": 1.0, \"partial\": false, \"is_public\": true, \"is_manually_managed\": false, \"date\": \"2025-11-05T14:38:40-05:00\", \"license\": null, \"og_image\": \"\", \"summary\": \"\", \"user_count\": 3, \"ac_rate\": 21.428571428571427, \"is_full_markup\": false, \"submission_source_visibility_mode\": \"F\", \"is_organization_private\": true, \"authors\": [2], \"curators\": [2], \"testers\": [2], \"types\": [3], \"allowed_languages\": [3, 17, 4, 16, 5, 6, 13, 15, 18, 11, 2, 9, 14, 7, 1, 8, 12, 10], \"banned_users\": [], \"organizations\": [2]}}]','Integrando Alianzas, Sumando Victorias 🎉🥳🎊',19,457,'default'),
