n\\r\\n| Nº ejercicio | ¿Resuelto correctamente? | Observaciones (por ejemplo, puntaje parcial) |\\r\\n|-------------|---------------------------|----------------------------------------------|\\r\\n| 1           | [ ] Sí   [ ] No           |                                              |\\r\\n| 2           | [ ] Sí   [ ] No           |                                              |\\r\\n| 3           | [ ] Sí   [ ] No           |                                              |\\r\\n\\r\\n**Total de ejercicios correctamente resueltos:** ____ / 2  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Criterio global de logro\\r\\n\\r\\nEl/la estudiante **resuelve correctamente al menos 2 de 3 ejercicios**  (Con esto obtiene la **nota máxima** según los criterios de la evaluación).\", \"start_time\": \"2025-12-10T16:55:56-05:00\", \"end_time\": \"2025-12-10T18:55:59-05:00\", \"time_limit\": null, \"is_visible\": true, \"is_rated\": false, \"scoreboard_visibility\": \"V\", \"use_clarifications\": true, \"rating_floor\": null, \"rating_ceiling\": null, \"rate_all\": false, \"is_private\": false, \"hide_problem_tags\": false, \"hide_problem_authors\": false, \"run_pretests_only\": false, \"show_short_display\": false, \"is_organization_private\": true, \"limit_join_organizations\": false, \"og_image\": \"\", \"logo_override_image\": \"\", \"user_count\": 0, \"summary\": \"\", \"access_code\": \"\", \"format_name\": \"default\", \"format_config\": null, \"problem_label_script\": \"\", \"locked_after\": \"2026-04-10T16:55:52-04:00\", \"points_precision\": 3, \"authors\": [2], \"curators\": [2], \"testers\": [2], \"spectators\": [], \"view_contest_scoreboard\": [], \"view_contest_submissions\": [], \"rate_exclude\": [], \"private_contestants\": [], \"organizations\": [2], \"join_organizations\": [], \"classes\": [], \"tags\": [], \"banned_users\": []}}]','Competencia 1 IMA-215 2026-1 [Taller2]]',6,687,'default'),
